  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "The single mutation path",
      "items": [
        "Approve: AdaptiveExperienceViewModel sends the reviewed plan digest (AdaptiveExperienceViewModel.swift:194-204, 327-339).",
        "AdaptiveTrustSession builds the approval at run time, so only the digest match and plan expiry can fail; the session, version and target checks compare the plan with itself (AdaptiveTrustSession.swift:200-217; ApprovalValidity.swift:57-73).",
        "Fresh rescan of only the plan's roots, never the shared display scan; only regular files in ~/Library/Caches/com.apple.iconservices.store get fresh evidence (AdaptiveTrustSession.swift:7-13, 112-119, 222-241).",
        "ReceiptHistoryCoordinator persists the intent and each transition, and calls the session's recorder for each move (ReceiptHistoryCoordinator.swift:68-98; AdaptiveTrustSession.swift:459-506).",
        "FoundationTrashAdapter re-checks device, inode, size, mtime, link count 1 and symlinks, then calls FileManager.trashItem; a short check-to-use gap remains (FoundationTrashAdapter.swift:32-33, 61-87, 116-165)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Eligibility lives in the pure core",
      "items": [
        "Only PolicyEvaluator.evaluateCache returns .eligible, and only inside one named folder, ~/Library/Caches/com.apple.iconservices.store: cache category, rebuildable, low risk, observed bytes (PolicyEvaluator.swift:117-170; PolicyEvaluation.swift:42-43, 88-98).",
        "The file must be unmodified for at least 15 minutes (PolicyEvaluation.swift:78-86; PolicyEvaluator.swift:65-75).",
        "A file a process holds open (lsof snapshot) is forced to in-use; if the listing fails, every ~/Library/Caches file counts as open (PolicyEvaluator.swift:18-22; OpenFileActivityObserver.swift:6-28).",
        "Owner catalog entries can relabel or narrow a cache, never make it eligible (PolicyEvaluator.swift:122-126)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Everything else is read-only",
      "items": [
        "Empty-Trash requests from Home and DiskCleaner go through SafetyNoticePresenter to DisabledOperationGateway, which answers disabled or deferred (SafetyNoticePresenter.swift:35-66; DisabledOperationGateway.swift:24-53).",
        "Besides the Trash move, the code writes only its own receipts in Application Support: intent and transition JSON, receipts.lock, and pruning of old receipts by rename + removeItem, plus UserDefaults settings (AppSupportReceiptStore.swift:21-40, 121-188, 277-311; ReceiptHistoryCoordinator.swift:129-150).",
        "Process() appears only in ReadOnlyProcess.swift: a closed ReadOnlyCommand enum of the five allowlisted commands, fixed arguments, a 10 s deadline (ReadOnlyProcess.swift:3-45; scripts/read-only-process-allowlist.txt).",
        "No network code in source: verify-safety-contract.sh fails on URLSession, URLRequest or Sparkle anywhere in the app (verify-safety-contract.sh:958-967), and UpdateCapability has the single case .unavailable (UpdateCapability.swift:3-8). The app is not sandboxed (MyMacCleaner.entitlements:5-6), so macOS does not enforce this."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Scan scope",
      "items": [
        "Roots: ~/Library/Caches, ~/Library/Logs, the temporary directory, Downloads, Desktop, Documents (GeneralMacScopeCatalog.swift:54-64; CleanerCoreLiveScan.swift:243-261).",
        "Per-root caps: depth 8, 25,000 entries, 10,000 findings (GeneralMacScopeCatalog.swift:16-24).",
        "GeneralMacFilesystemAdapter is a read-only, lazy walk: one entry per call (GeneralMacFilesystemAdapter.swift:92-93).",
        "Adaptive Experience also lists the Hugging Face and Ollama model stores, a folder the user picks, and developer-tool presence, read-only (CleanerCoreLiveScan.swift:45-56, 70-150)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Not drawn as arrows",
      "items": [
        "AdaptiveTrustSession also uses PermissionProbe for permission gaps and DarwinMemoryObservationAdapter for memory evidence (AdaptiveTrustSession.swift:43-45, 164-177).",
        "PerformanceViewModel uses CleanerCoreDarwin for memory observation (PerformanceViewModel.swift:31-39).",
        "DiskCleaner sizes ~/.Trash read-only through TrashInventoryReader (DiskCleanerViewModel.swift:161-170).",
        "CleanerCoreFoundation, CleanerCoreContentAdapter and CleanerCoreDarwin each depend only on CleanerCore (Package.swift:28-41); the app target links SafetyContract, CleanerCore, CleanerCoreDarwin and CleanerCoreFoundation (project.pbxproj:630-651)."
      ]
    }
  ]
